    <string name="dialog_about_message"><![CDATA[<b>C PIC Compiler</b><br><br>This application is a professional Graphical User Interface (GUI) for GPUTILS and SDCC toolchains.<br><br><b>GPUTILS:</b><br>Collection of open-source tools for Microchip PIC microcontrollers.<br><br>Website: <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/gputils/">sourceforge.net/projects/gputils/</a><br><br><b>SDCC (Small Device C Compiler):</b><br>Retargettable C compiler for 8-bit microcontrollers.<br><br>Website: <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/sdcc/">sourceforge.net/projects/sdcc/</a><br><br><b>Project License:</b><br>C PIC Compiler is free software released under the GNU GPL v3.0 license.<br><br>Included GPUTILS and SDCC binaries are also distributed under their respective GPL licenses.]]></string>

